{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──濑名同学总是迅速又俐落地完成班级干部的工作。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君，过来一下。”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0282", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯。怎么了？”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“班级干部的工作。要跟料理实习的老师报告分组的事。”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0283", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天也像这样，带着我去做许多干部的工作。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君！要去职员室了。下次上课的资料，各务台的同学的份不够。”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0284", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，了解。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那边结束后，顺便找八冢老师拿我们班考试范围要点的影印喔。”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0285", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“知道了，那边的我来搬吧……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她不停喊我一起做事，非常积极而且迅速确实地完成一件又一件的工作。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──为什么她会如此主动积极呢？", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然不懂，但我身为她的搭档也只能跟上去了。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要拖拖拉拉的！”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0286", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“立刻就去、立刻就去……”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也只能跟上去了……", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎、怎么样？好吃吗，瓜生君？”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "jc0023", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……嗯，好好吃！嗯，这个好好吃……”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀嗯～太好了安洁！”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "jc0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太好了呢。安洁的帮忙也有了回报♪”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0209", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然特别课程有很多不同的内容，不过大概是因为最初的关系，我觉得还是料理实习最轻松。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且班上的同学们也变得会拿成品来让我试味道。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思在你们开心的时候打扰，瓜生君，过来。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0287", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，爱理同学。”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0210", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“理科的老师好像身体不舒服，要去确认下一节课要不要换教室。”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0288", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、啊，知道了。抱歉喔，待会再来试味道吧……”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……被带走了。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0211", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔！濑名同学好狡猾～”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "jc0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦习惯了这种豪华，在学生食堂吃午饭也挺不错的。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君的便当总是很漂亮呢～”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu0115", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜！”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0053", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是樱乃花功夫帮我做的喔，对吧，樱乃？”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想既然要就读结女，就不能带随便的东西来。”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0262", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好用心喔……这种想法很重要呢。我也是要跟美羽学姐见面时就特别起劲。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "sn0058", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一直以来谢谢你，樱乃。多亏了你我从来不觉得比不上别人。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是也因此增加了不少伙食费吧。啊哈哈哈，真是难解啊～”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 500, "voice": "ht0142", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学生食堂的桌子很大，很适合多人一起吃饭聊天。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近一起吃午饭的人越来越多了。今天有天羽学姐、熊喵和乾同学。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0289", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？啊、我在。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟我来一下。刚才八冢老师说了些事……”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0290", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我去一下，大家慢慢吃喔。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呜噜。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0054", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君被带走了。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu0116", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君是爱理的奴隶吗？”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "sn0059", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理只喜欢找哥哥……”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0263", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种喜欢我可不要～”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 500, "voice": "ht0143", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……总之，剩下的就等放学后。尽快着手尽快结束。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0291", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0292", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有，了解了。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──虽然我拼命地跟上她。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本濑名同学的感应天线就很敏锐，再加上最近我身处人群中的机会也增加了很多。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以“跟大家在一起时被濑名同学带走”的情况就经常发生。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我是会在意周围反应的类型，突然离席让我对其他人感到抱歉。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而更让我在意的是……在大家的眼中看来，濑名同学动不动就把我带走的行为……", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那走吧。”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0293", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这女孩没有意识到吧。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0294", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，濑名同学依然沙沙沙地快速滑动笔尖。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰了～爱理同学、新吾同学，不嫌弃的话安洁去泡杯茶吧？”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0212", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢，但是我现在不想喝。”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0295", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她回答安洁的时候连头也没抬。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "该做的工作就专心一志认真地处理，全神贯注的姿态。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学都这样了，我也不能松懈。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然决定要跟上她了，就要尽全力跟上才行。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也不用了。抱歉喔安洁，谢谢你特地要帮忙泡茶。”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会。反倒是如果安洁也是班级干部的话就可以帮忙了，不好意思喔。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0213", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果有什么需要，请随时吩咐安洁。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0214", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，就快要结束了……”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0296", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，结束。”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0297", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔，辛苦了！”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0215", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好，我也结束了。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸！？”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0298", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多亏了我拼命努力的成果，第一次跟她同时结束了工作。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抬起头跟她对上了视线。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0299", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学维持着要站不站的姿势，尴尬地转开脸。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么看，都感觉是来不及说出“先回去了”的状态。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……同时完成工作不好吗？", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，让安洁泡杯茶来好吗～？”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0216", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不用──”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，爱理。”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0264", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正要阻止安洁的时候，樱乃推开门走了进来。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为中午好像就做了很多工作，所以想说今天或许可以一起回家。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0265", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个……该说时机很好还是很差呢……", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃走向濑名同学。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结束了？”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0266", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……刚、刚结束。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0300", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学越来越尴尬了。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理！太荣幸了，美羽学姐来约我们了喔！”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "sn0060", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君、小爱理～工作结束的话就一起回去吧……咦？”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu0117", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽学姐和乾同学也走了进来。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像时机刚刚好呢。一起回家吧？瓜生君、小爱理。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu0118", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，好的，我是没问题啦……”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞄了一眼濑名同学。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很感谢大家的邀请。但我还是很在意……", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学，你有什么其他紧急的事要做吗……？”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……今天不行吗？爱理。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0267", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0301", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃歪着头，询问濑名同学。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是天羽学姐还是樱乃，这种才艺我是办不到的，真厉害……", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是濑名同学她……", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……今天可以。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0302", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦！？是、是吗？”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，今天的话……”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0303", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她平常总是很快就回去，今天工作又做得特别快，我还以为她放学后还很忙呢……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来也不是经常都这样。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;“反倒是明天……”", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "“反倒是明天……”", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0304", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么。那今天就跟大家一起放学吧。”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0305", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0268", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，为弥补没有泡茶的遗憾，就让安洁送大家出门吧！”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0217", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0306", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看起来超不情愿的，真的可以吗？", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请慢走、请慢走～♪”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0218", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家明天见啰！”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu0119", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，今天要去美羽学姐家玩，很羡慕对吧？但是只有我去喔～”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "sn0061", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明明来约一起放学，但是却很快就脱队了……算了，说这些也没用……”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0307", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起走出校门后，因为家的位置不同，人数一下子就减少了。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉让你陪我们了，濑名同学。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这不是瓜生君要道歉的事。约的人是学姐和樱乃。”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0308", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就用聊天来弥补吧。”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0269", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许是被使命感驱使？樱乃点了点头，走到濑名同学身旁。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过再走一段路就要跟濑名同学道别了。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理平常都去哪里买东西呢？”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0270", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？呃……随便去。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0309", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0271", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我都去家附近的超市。还有那间久米超市，明天是促销日。”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0272", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔……！！”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0310", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学突然被绊到了脚。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0273", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0311", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看起来不像没什么的样子啊……", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过此时当然不能吐槽逼问她。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉抱歉，失礼了。樱乃继续说吧。”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……从蔬菜到日用品，都便宜得不得了。爱理觉得可以的话，我也推荐你去。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0274", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，仔细想想像濑名同学这种大小姐，不会去我们这种平民逛的超市吧？”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说也对。而且这里也有各务台商场呢，爱理。”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0275", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就、就是说啊……”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0312", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们第一次相遇，就是我去各务台商场的时候呢。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0276", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0313", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那……今天辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ar0314", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在分开的路口，往回家方向去的濑名同学……走得比平常还急，甚至像用跑的一样。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……爱理果然在赶什么事情吧。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0277", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有点对不起她。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0278", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～这个嘛……”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得如果真的没办法她也不会硬是陪我们，所以不用在意没关系喔，樱乃。”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我就放心了。”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0279", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格是让我放心的高手呢。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0280", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过对濑名同学却没有用呢……这句话我没有说出口。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
